<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41661" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχράω</span></b>  (C), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lend besides,</i> cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικίχρημι.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχράομαι</span></b> , <i>make use
				of besides,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. χθονί</span>
			<i>to have the use of</i> it <i>besides,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				942
			</span></i> ; <i>make use of also,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.39.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dat.
			pers., <i>have dealings with</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.41
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἐπιχρεώμεναι [αὐτῇ]
				μάλιστα γυναῖκες</span> her most <i>intimate</i> friends,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.99
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				953a
			</span></i>.</div>
